{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13918","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:17.406313+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @jorgeecardona \r\n\r\nIt looks like this issue has been resolved in the latest JAX versions. I executed the mentioned code in JAX version 0.4.24 without any errors:\r\n```Python\r\n>>> import jax\r\n>>> import jaxlib\r\n>>> import jax.numpy as jnp\r\n>>> \r\n>>> print(f\"jax version: {jax.__version__}\")\r\njax version: 0.4.24\r\n>>> print(f\"jaxlib version: {jaxlib.__version__}\")\r\njaxlib version: 0.4.24\r\n>>> x = jnp.array(0)\r\n>>> y = x\r\n>>> def f(x, y):\r\n...     return x\r\n... \r\n>>> f_ = jax.jit(f).lower(x, y).compile()\r\n>>> f_(x, y)\r\nArray(0, dtype=int32, weak_type=True)\r\n>>> f_(x, y)\r\nArray(0, dtype=int32, weak_type=True)\r\n>>> \r\n```\r\nThis [Gist](https://colab.sandbox.google.com/gist/selamw1/3f7a40adf48312dcb2bd07d5d6ae29e9/13918.ipynb) also demonstrates successful execution of the code in Colab using JAX version 0.4.23.","created_at":"2024-02-20T22:36:27Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/13918#issuecomment-1955235027","id":1955235027,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13918","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc50ioTT","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":1,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1955235027/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-02-20T22:36:27Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1955235027","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153962326?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar